+# Repo context (easy-repo-context)
+Outline, a collaborative team knowledge base: React web client, Koa API, real-time Y.js collaboration, optional plugins.
+
+## Commands
+- install: `yarn install` (yarn.lock)
+- build: `yarn run build:i18n` (package.json#scripts.build:i18n)
+- build: `yarn run build:server` (package.json#scripts.build:server)
+- build: `yarn run build` (package.json#scripts.build)
+- run: `yarn run start` (package.json#scripts.start)
+- run: `yarn run dev` (package.json#scripts.dev)
+- lint: `yarn run lint` (package.json#scripts.lint)
+- lint: `yarn run lint:changed` (package.json#scripts.lint:changed)
+
+## Where to look
+- Architecture, components, data stores: `.context/overview.md`
+- Invariants and traps: `.context/gotchas.md` (before changing code, read "Repo-wide" + the areas you touch)
+- Flows (read only the one matching the task):
+  - attachment-upload: attachments.create → presigned POST/PUT → browser uploads → (local storage) files.create → attachment row settles → `.context/flows/attachment-upload.md`
+  - comment-create: comments.create → lock document row → apply comment mark to ProseMirror state → silent save → comment row → `.context/flows/comment-create.md`
+  - document-list: documents.list → filter/status → membership-scoped query + COUNT → presented documents → `.context/flows/document-list.md`
+  - document-update: documents.update → documentUpdater → row lock → save → afterCommit collaboration notify → `.context/flows/document-update.md`
+  - share-create: shares.create → team `createShare` check → find-or-create unrevoked share → publish checks on stored share → `.context/flows/share-create.md`
